            "organizationNames": [],
            "name": "Focus Together: Body Doubling",
            "description": "<p>Feeling stuck or overwhelmed by your to-do list? Drop in on&nbsp;<strong>Focus Together</strong>, a virtual co-working session designed to help you build momentum, stay accountable, and feel supported without pressure.<br /><br />Whether you're studying, organizing your week, or tackling a personal project, this space offers a calm, community-centered environment where you can show up, set intentions, and get things done alongside others.<br /><br />Led by Rutgers Wellness Coaches and Peer Mental Health Educators,&nbsp;<strong>Focus Together</strong>&nbsp;blends structure with support, helping you tap into motivation through shared presence and mindful breaks.</p>\r\n<p>Who can benefit from a Body Doubling Session? Individuals experiencing stress, people with ADHD, those with anxiety, those needing some accountability support from their peers, and more.</p>\r\n<p>Register&nbsp;<a href=\"https://go.rutgers.edu/focustogether\">here</a>&nbsp;to receive the Zoom link</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>More dates to come</strong></em></p>",
            "location": "Online",
