            "name": "Coffee & Chat with LISSA",
            "description": "<p>LISSA is hosting an in-person event! Join us in the SC&amp;I Student Lounge for coffee, hot chocolate, and some snacks and chat with your fellow MI students.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div>Take this opportunity to foster some in-person connections and learn about LISSA!</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Register here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://forms.gle/u7zZwpBqEcGrGAAk9\">https://forms.gle/u7zZwpBqEcGrGAAk9</a></div>",
