            "organizationNames": [],
            "name": "Greek Culture Night",
            "description": "<p>Spend the evening exploring life in Greece through music, food, and tradition.&nbsp; A short presentation provided by faculty from the Department of Kinesiology and Exercise Science will explain the importance of the Mediterranean diet and lifestyle.&nbsp; A sampling of Greek foods and traditional Greek dancing will take place afterwards.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please RSVP if you will be attending.&nbsp; Space is limited.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
